# 跨平台文本：脚本统一 LF，避免 Windows checkout 后 shebang 变成 CRLF
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.ttf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
